  "note": "Source precedence and expiry for the claim registry, by claim class. Precedence orders publisher kinds from most to least authoritative for that class: where two pieces of evidence disagree, the one from the earlier kind wins, and the disagreement stays visible either way. expiryDays is added to an evidence row's retrievedAt to get its expiresAt. Expiry is a state transition, never a deletion. Nothing in the build reads this file yet; enforcement is Stage 3.",
